graph LR
    A[Update Dependencies] --> B[Fix Import Paths]
    B --> C[Replace Config Objects]
    C --> D[Wrap in TimeSeriesDataset]
    D --> E[Replace Pipeline Calls]
    E --> F[Migrate MLflow Config]
    F --> G[Run Test Suite]

    C1([PredictionJobDataClass]) -.->|maps to| C
    D1([raw DataFrame]) -.->|wraps to| D
    E1([train_model_pipeline]) -.->|becomes fit| E
    E2([create_forecast_pipeline]) -.->|becomes predict| E

    classDef primary fill:#00D9C5,stroke:#1E3A5F,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef secondary fill:#1E3A5F,stroke:#00D9C5,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef accent fill:#e6f7f5,stroke:#00D9C5,stroke-width:2px,color:#000

    class A,B,C,D,E,F,G primary
    class C1,D1 secondary
    class E1,E2 accent